Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:01.28,Cap,,0,0,0,,what the f***?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.28,0:00:01.66,Cap,,0,0,0,,could the new
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.66,0:00:02.70,Cap,,0,0,0,,orleans pelicans beat
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.70,0:00:04.74,Cap,,0,0,0,,five actual pelicans?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.74,0:00:05.44,Cap,,0,0,0,,except on monday
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.44,0:00:06.42,Cap,,0,0,0,,night, the warriors
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.42,0:00:07.12,Cap,,0,0,0,,beat them by
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.12,0:00:10.50,Cap,,0,0,0,,51, 138 to 87.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.50,0:00:11.16,Cap,,0,0,0,,new orleans shot
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.16,0:00:12.96,Cap,,0,0,0,,29 of 80, 8
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.96,0:00:14.60,Cap,,0,0,0,,of 28 from three.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.60,0:00:15.00,Cap,,0,0,0,,their biggest
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.00,0:00:15.98,Cap,,0,0,0,,lead all night?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.98,0:00:17.18,Cap,,0,0,0,,one point.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.18,0:00:17.76,Cap,,0,0,0,,steph curry played
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.76,0:00:19.98,Cap,,0,0,0,,21 minutes, scored 25,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.98,0:00:20.54,Cap,,0,0,0,,and watched the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.54,0:00:21.72,Cap,,0,0,0,,rest from the bench.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.72,0:00:22.32,Cap,,0,0,0,,so new orleans
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.32,0:00:23.26,Cap,,0,0,0,,takes on the birds
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.26,0:00:24.56,Cap,,0,0,0,,they're named after on
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.56,0:00:25.24,Cap,,0,0,0,,a court in the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.24,0:00:26.60,Cap,,0,0,0,,middle of the bayou.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.60,0:00:27.34,Cap,,0,0,0,,tip-off.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.34,0:00:28.04,Cap,,0,0,0,,a pelican just
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.04,0:00:28.90,Cap,,0,0,0,,flies over the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.90,0:00:30.64,Cap,,0,0,0,,jump ball, birds' ball.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.64,0:00:31.72,Cap,,0,0,0,,murray drives the lane.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.72,0:00:32.14,Cap,,0,0,0,,a pelican
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.14,0:00:33.28,Cap,,0,0,0,,opens its pouch.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.28,0:00:34.40,Cap,,0,0,0,,the ball goes in.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.40,0:00:35.84,Cap,,0,0,0,,it doesn't come out.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.84,0:00:36.20,Cap,,0,0,0,,fears pulls
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.20,0:00:37.34,Cap,,0,0,0,,up from three.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.34,0:00:37.98,Cap,,0,0,0,,air ball.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.98,0:00:38.78,Cap,,0,0,0,,a pelican catches
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.78,0:00:39.56,Cap,,0,0,0,,it in mid-air
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.56,0:00:40.34,Cap,,0,0,0,,and flies it
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.34,0:00:41.44,Cap,,0,0,0,,to the other rim.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.44,0:00:42.48,Cap,,0,0,0,,queen posts up.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.48,0:00:43.38,Cap,,0,0,0,,two pelicans land
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.38,0:00:44.36,Cap,,0,0,0,,on his shoulders.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.36,0:00:45.86,Cap,,0,0,0,,he still can't score.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.86,0:00:46.74,Cap,,0,0,0,,new orleans finally
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.74,0:00:47.80,Cap,,0,0,0,,hits a layup.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.80,0:00:49.04,Cap,,0,0,0,,they lead by one.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.04,0:00:50.20,Cap,,0,0,0,,the bench celebrates like
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.20,0:00:51.34,Cap,,0,0,0,,they won a title.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.34,0:00:52.24,Cap,,0,0,0,,at halftime, the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.24,0:00:53.96,Cap,,0,0,0,,birds are up 51.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.96,0:00:55.08,Cap,,0,0,0,,same as monday.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.08,0:00:56.02,Cap,,0,0,0,,fourth quarter.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.02,0:00:56.66,Cap,,0,0,0,,herb jones locks
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.66,0:00:57.88,Cap,,0,0,0,,one pelican up.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.88,0:00:58.46,Cap,,0,0,0,,the other four
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.46,0:01:00.02,Cap,,0,0,0,,just fly over him.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.02,0:01:01.06,Cap,,0,0,0,,final score, pelicans
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.06,0:01:03.72,Cap,,0,0,0,,138, pelicans 87.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.72,0:01:04.66,Cap,,0,0,0,,after the game,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.66,0:01:05.32,Cap,,0,0,0,,the league can't
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.32,0:01:06.32,Cap,,0,0,0,,tell who won.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.32,0:01:06.72,Cap,,0,0,0,,the birds
